# Start MathEducation

Read root AGENTS.md, docs/CONTEXT_MANIFEST.json, provenance/export-coverage.json and docs/ACCESS_HANDOFF.json. Run bun run doctor:cloud and bun run validate before editing. Select only the needed concept, relation, evidence and contract files. Do not treat derived UI payloads as the missing canonical workpacks. Report passed, failed, blocked and not-run separately. No server or credential is needed for the default checks; bun run preview is optional and binds loopback only.
